{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Which is the best fashion & clothing brand agency in Jaipur?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "ITD GrowthLabs is a senior-led website + branding + digital marketing + mobile app + AI + custom software agency for fashion & clothing brands in Jaipur. We combine 100+ D2C brand growth experience across India + international with regional cultural fluency + BIS + Ministry of AYUSH + FSSAI regulatory workflow. Blended ROAS 2.5x-4x typical for fashion. Ethnic + occasion + wedding 4x-6x during peaks. Athleisure 3x-5x with community + subscription. Luxury designer 4x-7x on higher AOV + longer consideration. Kids wear 3x-5x with parent-focused marketing."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How much does website design + branding + digital marketing cost for a fashion & clothing brand in Jaipur?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Website design + development: Rs80,000-Rs15 lakh depending on scope (brochure + full e-commerce + custom + AI-integrated). Brand identity + strategy: Rs60,000-Rs8 lakh. Digital marketing retainer: Rs1.5-Rs12 lakh/month + ad spend. Mobile app: Rs3-Rs30 lakh depending on complexity. AI + custom software: Rs2-Rs25 lakh+ project-based. Fixed-quote SOW within 48 hours of discovery call."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which fashion & clothing sub-verticals do you serve in Jaipur + India?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "All major sub-verticals: ethnic + saree + kurta + lehenga + Western + streetwear + athleisure + kids + modest + luxury designer. We adapt playbooks per sub-vertical (e.g. luxury vs mass-premium vs accessible; occasion vs everyday; heritage vs modern) + per regional + language + demographic segment across India."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have fashion & clothing case studies or references in Jaipur or India?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — India + Jaipur fashion & clothing + D2C case studies available on request under NDA. Mix of India-origin brands + heritage brands + emerging D2C + international brands entering India. Book a 30-min call and we'll share relevant references + case studies for your sub-vertical + budget stage."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you handle regional language + creative for Jaipur fashion & clothing brands?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — Hindi + English creative + content + landing pages + Meta + Google + Instagram + WhatsApp campaigns. Regional languages (Tamil + Telugu + Kannada + Bengali + Marathi + Gujarati + Punjabi) for regional expansion + tier-2/3 India + specific state markets. Festival + occasion + regional cultural calendar design."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long does it take to launch a website + brand + marketing for a fashion & clothing brand in Jaipur?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Brand identity + logo: 2-4 weeks. Website design + development: 4-10 weeks (brochure to full e-commerce). Mobile app: 8-16 weeks (MVP to full-feature). Digital marketing campaigns: qualified traffic in 1-2 weeks, optimised ROAS in 4-8 weeks. AI + custom software: 6-16 weeks. Parallel workstreams typical: brand + website + first marketing campaigns launch together in 8-12 weeks."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you handle BIS + Ministry of AYUSH + FSSAI regulatory for India fashion & clothing brands?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Advisory + workflow — not the certification body itself. BIS Cosmetics + BIS Hallmarking (jewellery) + Ministry of AYUSH (Ayurveda + drug claims) + FSSAI (F&B beauty) + state drug controller registration. IEC (Import Export Code) for international expansion. We coordinate with certification partners + regulatory consultants + guide founders through workflow + timelines + costs."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the typical ROAS + growth timeline for a fashion & clothing brand in Jaipur + India?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Blended ROAS 2.5x-4x typical for fashion. Ethnic + occasion + wedding 4x-6x during peaks. Athleisure 3x-5x with community + subscription. Luxury designer 4x-7x on higher AOV + longer consideration. Kids wear 3x-5x with parent-focused marketing. First qualified traffic: 1-2 weeks. Optimised ROAS: 4-8 weeks. Break-even unit economics: 3-6 months for well-positioned brands. Compounding brand + retention + LTV: 6-18 months. Diwali + wedding season + regional festival peaks concentrate 40-55% of annual revenue for occasion-driven categories."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work with luxury + premium fashion & clothing brands or only mass-market?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Both. Our fashion & clothing portfolio spans mass-accessible + affordable-premium + premium + luxury + ultra-luxury positioning. We adapt playbooks per positioning tier. Jaipur is a peak luxury + ultra-premium market and we have specific luxury go-to-market expertise (VIP + concierge + boutique + editorial + heritage storytelling)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I book a discovery call or connect with your team for Jaipur?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Three ways to start. Calendly: book a 30-min senior discovery call (no cost, no obligation). WhatsApp: chat with us directly. Contact form: fill the contact form. Senior strategist responds within 24 hours with a fixed-quote SOW. Prefer in-person? We travel to Jaipur for material engagements."}}]}
